{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34427","headline":"寄茅山何威仪二首 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"寄茅山何威仪二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾向人间拜节旄，乍疑因梦到仙曹。\n身轻曳羽霞襟狭，髻耸峨烟鹿帻高。\n山暖不荤峰上薤，水寒仍落洞中桃。\n从闻此日搜奇话，转觉魂飞夜夜劳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}